    "Korea's traditional attire, characterized by vibrant colors, simple lines, and elegant curves. Hanbok design varies by social status and season, featuring loose pants (baji) or skirts (chima) paired with a structured jacket (jeogori).": "Korea's traditional attire, characterized by vibrant colors, simple lines, and elegant curves. Hanbok design varies by social status and season, featuring loose pants (baji) or skirts (chima) paired with a structured jacket (jeogori).",
    "A meticulous 12-dish royal court feast (Surasang) served to Joseon Dynasty kings. Rooted in food philosophy that values natural ingredient balances, it incorporates seasonal side dishes, high-quality beef, marine delicacies, and herbal teas.": "A meticulous 12-dish royal court feast (Surasang) served to Joseon Dynasty kings. Rooted in food philosophy that values natural ingredient balances, it incorporates seasonal side dishes, high-quality beef, marine delicacies, and herbal teas.",
    "The explosive growth of Korean contemporary pop music, dramas (K-Dramas), and cinema. Built on synchronized dance routines, high production quality, and cross-cultural melodies, the Wave has transformed global youth culture.": "The explosive growth of Korean contemporary pop music, dramas (K-Dramas), and cinema. Built on synchronized dance routines, high production quality, and cross-cultural melodies, the Wave has transformed global youth culture.",
    "Built entirely on reclaimed land in Incheon, Songdo is Korea's futuristic eco-smart city. It integrates pneumatic waste disposal tunnels, IoT-enabled smart traffic grids, and greywater recycling systems, showing the cutting edge of modern urban life.": "Built entirely on reclaimed land in Incheon, Songdo is Korea's futuristic eco-smart city. It integrates pneumatic waste disposal tunnels, IoT-enabled smart traffic grids, and greywater recycling systems, showing the cutting edge of modern urban life.",
