    "A volcanic UNESCO World Heritage paradise. Explore Seongsan Ilchulbong Tuff Cone rising from the ocean, dramatic vertical basalt columns of Daepo Jusangjeolli Cliffs, and meet the legendary female divers, 'Haenyeo', who harvest seafood bare-handed.": "A volcanic UNESCO World Heritage paradise. Explore Seongsan Ilchulbong Tuff Cone rising from the ocean, dramatic vertical basalt columns of Daepo Jusangjeolli Cliffs, and meet the legendary female divers, 'Haenyeo', who harvest seafood bare-handed.",
    "A historic residential neighborhood in northern Seoul filled with hundreds of beautifully restored, traditional tile-roofed houses (Hanok) dating back to the Joseon Dynasty, standing in visual contrast to the surrounding glass skyscrapers.": "A historic residential neighborhood in northern Seoul filled with hundreds of beautifully restored, traditional tile-roofed houses (Hanok) dating back to the Joseon Dynasty, standing in visual contrast to the surrounding glass skyscrapers.",
    "Often called 'the museum without walls,' Gyeongju was the capital of the Silla Kingdom for 992 years. It features ancient royal burial mounds, Daereungwon, Cheomseongdae observatory, and Bulguksa Temple.": "Often called 'the museum without walls,' Gyeongju was the capital of the Silla Kingdom for 992 years. It features ancient royal burial mounds, Daereungwon, Cheomseongdae observatory, and Bulguksa Temple.",
    "Perched dramatically on a rocky cliff directly facing the crashing waves of the East Sea. Unlike most Korean temples nestled deep within serene mountains, this unique sanctuary offers a sweeping ocean view and beautiful stone stairs.": "Perched dramatically on a rocky cliff directly facing the crashing waves of the East Sea. Unlike most Korean temples nestled deep within serene mountains, this unique sanctuary offers a sweeping ocean view and beautiful stone stairs.",
    "The iconic N Seoul Tower standing atop Mount Namsan offers sweeping, panoramic vistas of the massive Seoul metropolis. Below, traditional gates and busy historic markets buzz in harmonious chaos.": "The iconic N Seoul Tower standing atop Mount Namsan offers sweeping, panoramic vistas of the massive Seoul metropolis. Below, traditional gates and busy historic markets buzz in harmonious chaos.",
    "The massive, double-decked suspension bridge stretching across the ocean in Busan. At night, it features spectacular multi-colored artistic LED light shows that reflect across the shimmering waters of Gwangalli Beach.": "The massive, double-decked suspension bridge stretching across the ocean in Busan. At night, it features spectacular multi-colored artistic LED light shows that reflect across the shimmering waters of Gwangalli Beach.",
