    "A sprawling metropolis where 600-year-old palaces sit surrounded by towering glass skyscrapers. Seoul is a 24-hour city where tranquil mountain hikes, traditional markets, design centers, and dynamic nightlife districts exist side-by-side.": "600年历史的古老宫殿与摩天大楼交相辉映的国际大都会。从宁静的山间徒步到传统市场、时尚设计中心及夜景，24小时精彩不断。",
    "Korea's island paradise, dominated by Hallasan, an extinct volcano. Renowned for its unique black basalt stones, scenic ocean cliffs, pristine beaches, and the legendary Haenyeo (female breath-hold divers) who harvest fresh seafood from the cold deeps.": "以汉拿山为核心的度假天堂。拥有独特的黑色玄武岩、绝美海岸断崖与无需氧气罐潜水捕捞的联合国教科文组织海女文化。",
    "The ancient capital of the Silla Kingdom for nearly 1,000 years. Gyeongju is packed with massive grass-covered royal tomb mounds, ancient temples, ruins, and the world's oldest surviving astronomical observatory, Cheomseongdae.": "新罗王朝延续近千年的古都。整座城市遍布巨大王陵古坟丘、古老寺庙遗址及东亚现存最古老的天文台瞻星台。",
    "Korea's largest port city, famous for its energetic coastal atmosphere, sandy beaches, colorful mountainside arts villages, seafood markets, and scenic suspension bridges glowing over the sea.": "韩国最大的港口城市。以活力四射的海滨氛围、海云台沙滩、色彩斑斓的甘川文化村、札嘎其海鲜市场及壮丽的广安大桥夜景闻名。",
    "Korea's largest spring festival, attracting millions of visitors who walk under tunnels of over 360,000 blooming cherry blossom trees. The Yeojwacheon Stream and Gyeonghwa Station railway are famous photo spots.": "漫步于36万株樱花隧道下的韩国最大春季盛会。余佐川罗曼史桥与庆和站樱花铁路是全球游客瞩目的摄影胜地。",
    "An energetic, wild summer party where locals and tourists slather themselves in mineral-rich mud known for its cosmetic properties. Expect giant mud slides, mud wrestling, beach concerts, and firework shows.": "涂抹富含矿物质天然海泥的夏日狂欢节。拥有巨型泥浆滑梯、海滩泥浆摔跤、日落电音派对与璀璨烟火秀。",
