    "King Sejong the Great commissioned Hunminjeongeum in 1443. He declared that the common people needed a phonetic script that could be learned easily in a single morning, replacing complex classical Chinese characters.": "世宗大王于1443年创制了训民正音。他希望普通百姓无需学习繁难的汉字，在一个早晨内就能轻松学会使用这一高度科学的表音文字。",
