    "Nestled at the foot of Jirisan Mountain, this scenic local festival signals spring with vibrant yellow Cornelian cherry (Sansuyu) blossoms painting ancient stone-wall villages.": "这个风景秀丽的当地节日坐落在智异山脚下，以充满活力的黄色山茱萸花朵描绘了古老的石墙村庄，标志着春天的到来。",
    "Ranked among the world's top 5 tulip festivals, Taean displays over 2 million vibrant tulips of 200 species planted in intricate artistic patterns right by the Yellow Sea.": "泰安郁金香节被列为世界排名前 5 的郁金香节，展示了 200 个品种、超过 200 万株郁金香，这些郁金香以复杂的艺术图案种植在黄海沿岸。",
    "Walking through golden reed fields during sunset over the coastal mudflats": "日落时分，在沿海泥滩上漫步，穿过金色的芦苇田",
