    "A cultural festival celebrating Korea's traditional masked performance arts (Talchum). Set in a UNESCO folk village, the performances incorporate satrical storylines mocking historic elites, set to rhythmic drumming.": "庆祝韩国传统蒙面表演艺术（Talchum）的文化节。表演以联合国教科文组织民俗村为背景，结合了嘲讽历史精英的讽刺故事情节和有节奏的鼓乐。",
    "The historical stream cutting through downtown Seoul is illuminated by hundreds of massive, intricate paper lanterns crafted from traditional Hanji paper, depicting historical scenes, characters, and futuristic concepts.": "穿过首尔市中心的历史溪流被数百个由传统韩纸制成的巨大而复杂的纸灯笼照亮，描绘了历史场景、人物和未来概念。",
    "A spectacular and grand fire festival where an entire volcanic hill (Saebyeol Oreum) is set ablaze to pray for health, good harvest, and happiness in the new year, deriving from ancient traditions of burning old grass to clear pests.": "这是一场壮观而盛大的火祭，整个火山（新星岳）被点燃，祈求新的一年健康、丰收和幸福，源自燃烧老草清除害虫的古老传统。",
    "One of Korea's most stunning floating lantern festivals. Thousands of beautifully illuminated lanterns float on the Nam River, commemorating the historical defense during the Imjin War (1592) when lanterns were used as military signals and to send messages to families.": "韩国最令人惊叹的水上灯笼节之一。南江上漂浮着数千盏灯火辉煌的灯笼，纪念临津战争（1592 年）期间的历史保卫战，当时灯笼被用作军事信号并向家人传递信息。",
    "Celebrating Korea's agricultural golden fields, this festival is held at Byeokgolje, the oldest reservoir in Korea. Gimje is the only region in Korea where a clear flat horizon can be seen, symbolizing the abundance of land.": "这个节日是为了庆祝韩国的农业黄金田，在韩国最古老的水库碧谷堤举行。金堤是韩国唯一可以看到平坦地平线的地区，象征着土地的丰富。",
    "Set in the breathtaking, terraced green tea plantations of Boseong, this spring festival allows visitors to fully immerse themselves in green tea culture—from picking fresh leaves to making and tasting premium green tea.": "这个春节以宝城令人惊叹的梯田绿茶种植园为背景，让游客充分沉浸在绿茶文化中——从采摘新鲜茶叶到制作和品尝优质绿茶。",
    "Recognized as one of the world's seven winter wonders, this freezing festival welcomes millions to catch mountain trout (Sancheoneo) through holes drilled into a 40cm-thick frozen river, or even plunge bare-handed into cold pools.": "这个寒冷的节日被认为是世界七大冬季奇迹之一，吸引了数百万人通过在 40 厘米厚的冰冻河中钻的孔捕捉山鳟鱼 (Sancheoneo)，甚至徒手跳入冰冷的水池中。",
