    "Pick your personal exploration style to reconfigure the day.": "选择您的个人探索风格来重新安排这一天。",
    "Step": "步",
    "Travel Style": "旅行方式",
    "A cultural festival celebrating Korea's traditional masked performance arts (Talchum). Set in a UNESCO folk village, the performances incorporate satirical storylines mocking historic elites.": "庆祝韩国传统蒙面表演艺术（Talchum）的文化节。表演以联合国教科文组织民俗村为背景，融入了嘲笑历史精英的讽刺故事情节。",
    "Nam River & Jinjuseong Fortress, Jinju-si": "晋州市南江和晋州城",
    "One of Korea's most stunning floating lantern festivals. Thousands of beautifully illuminated lanterns float on the Nam River, commemorating the historical defense during the Imjin War (1592).": "韩国最令人惊叹的水上灯笼节之一。南江上漂浮着数千盏美丽的灯笼，纪念临津战争（1592 年）期间的历史保卫战。",
    "Byeokgolje, Gimje-si, Jeollabuk-do": "全罗北道金堤市碧谷堤",
    "Celebrating Korea's agricultural golden fields, this festival is held at Byeokgolje, the oldest reservoir in Korea. Gimje is the only region in Korea with a clear flat horizon.": "这个节日是为了庆祝韩国的农业黄金田，在韩国最古老的水库碧谷堤举行。金堤是韩国唯一地平线清晰的地区。",
    "Seoul International Fireworks Festival": "首尔国际烟花节",
    "Yeouido Hangang Park, Seoul": "首尔汝矣岛汉江公园",
    "Early October": "十月初",
    "One of Asia's largest pyrotechnic spectacles, where world-class fireworks teams illuminate the night sky over the Han River and 63 Building with synchronized music.": "亚洲最大的烟火表演之一，世界一流的烟花团队伴随着同步音乐照亮汉江和 63 大厦的夜空。",
    "Dazzling fireworks set to classical and K-Pop music reflected on the Han River": "伴随着古典和韩国流行音乐的耀眼烟花倒映在汉江上",
    "Busan International Fireworks Festival": "釜山国际烟火大会",
