    "Dynamic Maritime Hub, Coastal Temples, and Sandy Shores": "Hub maritime dynamique, temples côtiers et plages de sable",
    "A sprawling metropolis where 600-year-old palaces sit surrounded by towering glass skyscrapers. Seoul is a 24-hour city where tranquil mountain hikes, traditional markets, design centers, and dynamic nightlife districts exist side-by-side.": "Une métropole vibrante où les palais vieux de 600 ans côtoient des gratte-ciel modernes. Séoul vit 24h/24 entre randonnées, marchés traditionnels et design futuriste.",
    "Korea's island paradise, dominated by Hallasan, an extinct volcano. Renowned for its unique black basalt stones, scenic ocean cliffs, pristine beaches, and the legendary Haenyeo (female breath-hold divers) who harvest fresh seafood from the cold deeps.": "Le paradis insulaire de la Corée dominé par le mont Hallasan. Célèbre pour ses falaises volcaniques, ses plages et les légendaires plongeuses Haenyeo.",
    "The ancient capital of the Silla Kingdom for nearly 1,000 years. Gyeongju is packed with massive grass-covered royal tomb mounds, ancient temples, ruins, and the world's oldest surviving astronomical observatory, Cheomseongdae.": "L'ancienne capitale du royaume de Silla pendant près de 1 000 ans. Elle regorge de tumulus royaux, de temples et du plus vieil observatoire d'Asie, Cheomseongdae.",
    "Korea's largest port city, famous for its energetic coastal atmosphere, sandy beaches, colorful mountainside arts villages, seafood markets, and scenic suspension bridges glowing over the sea.": "La plus grande ville portuaire de Corée, célèbre pour sa côte dynamique, ses plages, le village coloré de Gamcheon et son marché aux poissons.",
