    "Dynamic Maritime Hub, Coastal Temples, and Sandy Shores": "Dinámico centro marítimo, templos costeros y playas doradas",
    "A sprawling metropolis where 600-year-old palaces sit surrounded by towering glass skyscrapers. Seoul is a 24-hour city where tranquil mountain hikes, traditional markets, design centers, and dynamic nightlife districts exist side-by-side.": "Una metrópolis vibrante donde palacios de 600 años conviven con rascacielos. Seúl nunca duerme, combinando mercados tradicionales, diseño y vida nocturna.",
    "Korea's island paradise, dominated by Hallasan, an extinct volcano. Renowned for its unique black basalt stones, scenic ocean cliffs, pristine beaches, and the legendary Haenyeo (female breath-hold divers) who harvest fresh seafood from the cold deeps.": "El paraíso insular de Corea presidido por el monte Hallasan. Famoso por sus rocas volcánicas, playas vírgenes y las legendarias buceadoras Haenyeo.",
    "The ancient capital of the Silla Kingdom for nearly 1,000 years. Gyeongju is packed with massive grass-covered royal tomb mounds, ancient temples, ruins, and the world's oldest surviving astronomical observatory, Cheomseongdae.": "La antigua capital del reino de Silla durante casi 1.000 años. Repleta de túmulos reales, templos y el observatorio más antiguo de Asia, Cheomseongdae.",
    "Korea's largest port city, famous for its energetic coastal atmosphere, sandy beaches, colorful mountainside arts villages, seafood markets, and scenic suspension bridges glowing over the sea.": "La mayor ciudad portuaria de Corea, famosa por su energía costera, playas, el colorido pueblo de Gamcheon y el mercado de pescado Jagalchi.",
