    "Korea's largest spring festival, attracting millions of visitors who walk under tunnels of over 360,000 blooming cherry blossom trees. The Yeojwacheon Stream and Gyeonghwa Station railway are famous photo spots.": "El mayor festival de primavera de Corea con más de 360.000 cerezos en flor a lo largo del arroyo Yeojwacheon y la estación Gyeonghwa.",
    "An energetic, wild summer party where locals and tourists slather themselves in mineral-rich mud known for its cosmetic properties. Expect giant mud slides, mud wrestling, beach concerts, and firework shows.": "Una fiesta veraniega salvaje y enérgica donde cubrirse de barro mineral, con toboganes gigantes, conciertos y fuegos artificiales.",
